(26002,251,'2026-06-03 15:18:46','2026-06-03 13:18:46','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The project variant is probably the strongest of the set.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What makes it work is that it finally gives \"Projekt\" its own visual language instead of looking like a mini-Ausstellung or mini-Veranstaltung:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>layered folders → work in progress</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>dossier card → research process</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>map fragment → place-based investigation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>numbering system → archive logic</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>document stack → accumulation of knowledge</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>red headline → institutional consistency</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It also fits the way you actually use projects on the site. Your projects are not startup projects, funding campaigns, or marketing initiatives. They are closer to research dossiers that connect places, archives, publications, exhibitions, videos, and future work.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Looking across the whole family now:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Veranstaltung = institutional announcement</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Vortrag = lecture</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Gespräch = dialogue</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lesung = publication / text</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Fest = program board</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Video = media archive</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ort &amp; Gebäude = architecture</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Projekt = dossier / research</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Each type has a distinct metaphor while remaining recognizably Industriesalon.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For a museum and industrial heritage institution, that is much stronger than the usual approach of putting different stock photos behind different labels.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This now feels like a genuine content system rather than placeholder graphics.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','123','','publish','closed','closed','','123','','','2026-06-03 15:29:04','2026-06-03 13:29:04','',0,'/?post_type=veranstaltung&#038;p=26002',0,'veranstaltung','',0),
